      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NATHANS DREAMER (1) drew out and raced up to four wide when resuming with a third at Cranbourne. Has won a trial since so should have come on and draws to get every chance. KYVALLEY JOYRIDE NZ (7) has had two runs this prep and while yet to finish in the top three he hasn't been too far off the placings, last time finishing just behind NATHANS DREAMER. Tactics will be crucial from this wide draw but he should be hitting peak fitness. INTHE NORTY CORNER (2) faces the starter for the first time. By On A Streak and hails from the Kyle Marshall stable. Has the benefit of a good draw so look for a strong showing. ARIVADERCHI (3) is a long-time maiden but may be competitive from a good draw.",
